            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Use roots ",
                "marks": []
              },
              {
                "type": "math",
                "latex": "r,r,\\frac{1}{r},\\frac{1}{r}",
                "display": false
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": " and the sums of roots and pairwise products.",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "worked": "Let the roots be $r,r,\\frac{1}{r},\\frac{1}{r}$.\n$$\\begin{align*}2r+\\frac2r&=-\\frac{-20}{4}\\\\r+\\frac1r&=\\frac52.\\end{align*}$$\nThe six pairwise products give\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{k}{4}&=r^2+\\frac1{r^2}+4\\\\\\frac{k}{4}&=\\left(r+\\frac1r\\right)^2-2+4\\\\\\frac{k}{4}&=\\left(\\frac52\\right)^2+2\\\\\\frac{k}{4}&=\\frac{33}{4}\\\\k&=33.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
